'''Maawth''' (レディ・ガ ''Redi Ga'', "'''Lady Ga"''' or lit. "'''Lady Moth'''") is an [[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]]/[[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]] variant of [[Mooth]] that appears in [[Into the Future]], [[Cats of the Cosmos]] and [[Legend Stages]]. He was added in [[Version 4.0 Update|Version 4.0]].

