==Enemy==
The Alien variant of [[Mooth]]. He has more health, damage, range, and his attacks have a 30% chance to freeze cats. He is a bit slower than his non-Alien counterpart, but don't let that fool you, as he is much deadlier than Mooth.

==Strategy==
When you first encounter Maawth, he can be fairly hard if you don't have [[Bahamut Cat (Special Cat)|Bahamut Cat]], but is still manageable assuming you haven't been slacking on your [[Empire of Cats]] [[Treasure]]s. Just spam meatshields, [[Lizard Cat (Normal Cat)|Dragon Cats]] and other ranged attackers. Despite having two easily exploitable traits, most [[:Category:Anti-Floating Cats|anti-Floating]]/[[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]] [[:Category:Rare Cats|Rares]] and [[:Category:Super Rare Cats|Super Rares]] ([[Archer Cat (Rare Cat)|Cataur]] not withstanding) don't have the range to hit him consistently and thus should not be relied upon.

