==Trivia==
*Maawth's name may be derived from マーズ ''Māzu'' (Mars), 真新しい ''maatarashii'' (brand new), the archaic, Classical Japanese word 真青 ''maao'' (deep blue or entirely blue; the more common reading of this word is ''masao''), ''maw'' and ''moth''.
*His Japanese name, Lady Ga (レディ・ガ ''Redi Ga''), is a reference to the pop artist [[wikipedia:Lady Gaga|Lady Gaga]]; the joke is that ''Ga'' can mean moth.
**It might also be a reference to the [[wikipedia:Mormo maura|old lady moth]], [[wikipedia:Dasypodia cymatodes|northern old lady moth]], or [[wikipedia:Dasypodia selenophora|southern old lady moth]].
*He is the only [[Mooth]] variant whose Japanese name has no repeated syllables.
*Prior to [[The Battle Cats|BCEN]] [[Version 12.5 Update|12.5]], the [[Enemy Guide]] entries for Maawth, [[I.M. Phace]], [[Cli-One]] and [[Cosmic Cyclone]] listed their traits as "([[:Category:Alien Enemies|Alien]], [[:Category:Floating Enemies|Floating]])" instead of "(Alien/Floating)".

